    decisions: 'Record account topology, region strategy, network architecture, compute, data, identity, KMS ownership, recovery, delivery, observability, and cost choices. Compare alternatives such as ECS versus EKS, Aurora versus DynamoDB, centralized versus distributed networking, and single versus multi-region operation.',
    operations: 'Define account lifecycle, policy changes, access reviews, patching, upgrades, incident response, backup testing, deployments, cost reviews, quota management, and decommissioning. Give each migration wave measurable entry, acceptance, and rollback criteria.',
