    learningPoints: ['When Cloud Run, GKE Standard, and GKE Autopilot fit different operating and control requirements.', 'How clusters, node pools, pods, services, ingress, identity, storage, networking, and policy connect.', 'How to secure artifacts, isolate workloads, upgrade safely, scale, and observe container platforms.'],
